# Owner-approved M4 local search runtime (R4): the LanceDB local vector index
# plus the FastEmbed encoder consumed by src/search/local_vector.py. Kept out
# of the default application lock (requirements.lock) so the heavy native
# stack stays scoped to machines that opt into local semantic search; compiled
# to requirements-search.lock with hashes and installed only with
# --require-hashes (services.yaml: commands lock-search / install-search).
# Shared dependencies (onnxruntime 1.28.0, huggingface-hub, numpy, pillow,
# tokenizers, tqdm, requests, packaging, pydantic, urllib3, ...) are pinned
# by the compile-time --constraints requirements.lock and must not drift.
# overrides (lancedb; python_version<'3.12') is intentionally absent.
